1. Customer → Account (OWNS)
LOAD CSV WITH HEADERS
FROM 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/snehadave7/customer360Data/main/account.csv'
AS row

MATCH (c:Customer {customerId: row.Customer_ID})
MATCH (a:Account {accountId: row.Account_ID})

CREATE (c)-[:OWNS]->(a);

Verify:
MATCH p=(c:Customer)-[:OWNS]->(a:Account)
RETURN p;

